<https://www.glossarist.org/dpp/dpp/> dcterms:description "Digital Product Passport terminology harvested from the\nEN 18216–18246:2026 terms-and-definitions clauses, CWA 18291:2025\nand IDTA 01001-3.2, plus framework terms proposed by UniDPP and\nmarked as such. Working dataset; the single source of truth for\nthe proposed ISO 25534-1 Part 1 (Vocabulary) draft.";
